  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BlueSkyOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to BlueSky and the AT Protocol. Maps BlueSky user profiles to OASIS Avatars and posts (app.bsky.feed.post records) to OASIS Holons. Authentication via app passwords or OAuth. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- feat: add 6 new OASIS providers — BlueSky, Matrix, Filecoin, Algorand, Ceramic, Basechain (b2e78ba)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- Integrate provider capabilities and reuse deployed service configuration (8ac7f1f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Social/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BlueSkyOASIS",
